title: "Complete ternary projective Reed–Muller weight hierarchies on PG(4,3)"
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-28
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "Completes the positive-degree generalized Hamming weight hierarchies for ternary projective Reed–Muller codes on PG(4,3). A second incidence moment determines the last new value, degree six and rank 31, as 45. No claim is made for other projective dimensions or fields."
